    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">FRIENDS of Sullivan's Island Elementary School ('FRIENDS,' 'we,' 'us') respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect through siesfriends.org, how we use it, and your choices.</p>
