<section aria-labelledby="effective-date">
  <p id="effective-date"><strong>Effective date:</strong> 08/25/2026 </p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="info-we-collect">
  <h2 id="info-we-collect">Information we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Information you give us:</strong> when you use a form on our site (such as the volunteer sign-up) we collect the name, email address, and any message you provide; when you email us we receive what you send.</p>
  <p><strong>Donations:</strong> we do not process or store payment information ourselves — donations are handled by our partners, including the Coastal Community Foundation of South Carolina and event platforms such as Event.Gives and RunSignUp, on their own secure systems and subject to their privacy policies.</p>
  <p><strong>Automatically collected:</strong> we use Plausible Analytics, a privacy-friendly service, to understand overall traffic; Plausible does not use cookies and does not collect personal data or track you across sites — it reports only aggregate, anonymous statistics.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="how-we-use">
  <h2 id="how-we-use">How we use information</h2>
  <p>We use information to respond to you, coordinate volunteers, acknowledge and steward donations, and improve our website and programs.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="how-we-share">
  <h2 id="how-we-share">How we share information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We share it only with service providers who help us operate (for example, our email and form-processing tools) and as required by law.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="cookies">
  <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our site does not use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="childrens-privacy">
  <h2 id="childrens-privacy">Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Our site is intended for parents, guardians, and community members. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="links-other-sites">
  <h2 id="links-other-sites">Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Our site links to third-party sites such as our donation platform; we are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="your-choices">
  <h2 id="your-choices">Your choices</h2>
  <p>You may ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information you have provided by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="changes">
  <h2 id="changes">Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy; the effective date shows the latest revision.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="contact">
  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
